@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### List links (contains the seeded dotnet/docker links)
GET {{host}}/api/links

### Create a link
POST {{host}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core"
}

### Get a link by code
GET {{host}}/api/links/dotnet

### Redirect (does not follow the redirect)
GET {{host}}/dotnet

### Delete a link
DELETE {{host}}/api/links/dotnet
